          "coast_release_jump_4": "Release directions+A+B4frames. Reduce acceleration while descending to a safe landing and prepare a fresh jump. Existing momentum can persist.",
          "fresh_running_jump_40": "Hold right+B, release A for1frame then hold A40frames. Start a full sustained running jump when Mario feet visibly stand on ground/platform and a nearby visible obstacle or gap requires height/distance. Issuing this in midair cannot start a fresh jump on landing.",
          "fresh_walking_jump_40": "Hold right, release B; release A1frame then hold A40frames. Start a full walking jump from a visible solid surface to clear a tall obstacle with less horizontal travel. Cannot start a new jump while airborne.",
          "run_forward_4": "Hold right+B, release A, 4frames. Advance on clear ground, descend toward landing, or release A so a fresh jump can follow.",
          "run_forward_8": "Hold right+B, release A, 8frames. Advance along safe ground or descend to land before initiating another jump.",
          "run_left_8": "Hold left+B, release A8frames. Back away from a wall/hazard or create room for a future jump.",
          "sustain_running_jump_8": "Hold right+B+A8frames. Sustain a rising jump for height; do not release A early if a tall obstacle must be cleared. Does not reset A for a fresh jump.",
